   "sourceHash": "c438be469f3f4432f27ae1b81ae86595f3d5a2b5b4d1b497fd0037ca98816ddd",
   "text": "如有付款问题或收到无法识别的付款请求，请在付款前联系 info@kairali.com 或致电 +91 9555 156 156。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
